~ story
Once upon a time Yeong-Gi was a monk living in a buddhist monastery

The monks there had to make vow of silence. Following the word from the Buddah itself...

But Yeong-Gi liked too much to speak.
One day he got caught by the monastery master talking to a villager.

Monastery Master: ... ... .....
Yeong-Gi was excluded from the other monks

Enraged, he decided to go up to the TEN, heaven where Buddha resides and ask him to put an end to this stupid vow of silence

But the way is long, protected by the 4 ShiTENno kings \: TamonTEN, JikokuTEN, ZochoTEN and KomokuTEN...

Will Yeong-Gi show that the power of spoken words can lead him to Buddha ?
=> END